                        {
                            "text": "A stone hut stood in the <w>lithe</w> of the rocky crag, offering safety to shepherds.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "it": "Una capanna di pietra sorgeva al <w>rifugio</w> dello sperone roccioso, offrendo sicurezza ai pastori."
                            }
